  (text "SAFE DEFAULT:\nR2 (10k) on GD1 input pulls HIGH when MCU off\n=> Q1 ON => motor dead-shorted = safe" (at 121.92 55.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "Q1: N-ch low-side brake FET\nTIM3_CH1 INVERTED polarity\nCCR=0 => FET ON => dead short\nCCR=2720 => ~8ohm\nCCR=3199 => FET OFF" (at 185.42 82.55 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "Q2: P-ch high-side keep-alive FET\nTIM3_CH2 normal polarity\nCCR=0 => FET OFF\nCCR=774 => ~3V injected" (at 185.42 120.65 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "D4: MODE C ESSENTIAL\nBlocks reverse current into Q2\nwhen Q1 hard-brakes the track.\nOmit on mode A/B-only boards." (at 210.82 132.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "POT MAPPING (all modes):\nCCW => min brake (~8 ohm)\nCW  => max brake (dead short)\nMode A: centre = dead short\n        CW past centre = antibrake 0-3V" (at 10.16 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "COMPONENT LIST:\nU1  STM32G041K6U6  QFN-32\nU2  AMS1117-3.3    SOT-223\nGD1 UCC27524       SOT-23-5  (brake gate driver)\nGD2 UCC27524       SOT-23-5  (keep-alive gate driver)\nQ1  IRLB3034       D2PAK     (N-ch brake FET)\nQ2  IRF9Z34N       D2PAK     (P-ch keep-alive FET)\nD1  P6KE15A        SMB       (TVS rail clamp)\nD2  SS34           SMB       (Q1 catch diode)\nD3  SS34           SMB       (Q2 catch diode)\nD4  SS34           SMB       (mode C series protection)\nD5  LED Red        0805      (status LED)\nF1  Polyfuse 25A   1812\nC1  10uF  0805  C2  100nF 0402  (LDO in decouple)\nC3  10uF  0805  C4  100nF 0402  (LDO out decouple)\nC5  100nF 0402  C6  100nF 0402  C7  4u7 0402  (MCU decouple)\nR1  10k 0402 (NRST)  R2  10k 0402 (safe default)\nR3  10R 0402 (Q1 gate)  R4  10R 0402 (Q2 gate)\nR5  10k 0402 (pot ref)  R6  10k 0402 (btn pullup)\nR7  1k  0402 (btn series)  R8  15k 0402  R9  4k7 0402 (rail sense)\nR10 330R 0402 (LED)\nJ1  2-pin 5mm (track output)  J2  2-pin 5mm (12V rail in)\nJ3  2-pin 5mm (controller in)  J4  3-pin 2.54mm (pot)\nJ5  3-pin 2.54mm (toggle)  J6  2-pin 2.54mm (capture btn)\nJ7  2-pin 2.54mm (wiper strip)" (at 10.16 131.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
